7. Bank Interest Calculator
Python
principal = float(input("Enter principal amount: "))
rate = float(input("Enter annual interest rate (in %): "))
time = float(input("Enter time period (in years): "))
# Simple Interest
si = (principal * rate * time) / 100
# Compound Interest (compounded annually)
ci_total_amount = principal * ((1 + (rate / 100)) ** time)
ci = ci_total_amount - principal
print(f"\nSimple Interest accrued: ${si:.2f}")
print(f"Compound Interest accrued: ${ci:.2f}")

