17. Password Strength Checker
Python
password = input("Enter a password to evaluate: ")
has_upper = any(c.isupper() for c in password)
has_lower = any(c.islower() for c in password)
has_digit = any(c.isdigit() for c in password)
has_special = any(not c.isalnum() for c in password)
valid_length = len(password) >= 8
if has_upper and has_lower and has_digit and has_special and valid_length:
print("Password Evaluation Result: Strong Password")
else:
print("Password Evaluation Result: Weak Password (Must contain at least
8 characters, upper/lowercase metrics, numbers, and special symbols)")

